Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|testray.main.component.name|Plugin Installer|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Scenario: Akismet Portlet Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|portlet.plugins.includes|akismet-portlet|
	When these variables
		|appName|Akismet|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|Akismet|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|App Manager|
	And AppManager uninstall App CP
		|appName|${appName}|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|App Manager|
	Then AppManager view Uninstall App CP
		|appName|${appName}|